    "title": "Meet the Candidates: Peter Bencker - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mike Peterson ,\n14 hours ago (Glenwood) -- KMA News continues its \"Meet the Candidates\" series, featuring the candidates running in key races in the June Iowa Primary. Today, we turn our attention to the race for the Mills County Board of Supervisors' Republican nomination. Three candidate vie for the opening created by Richard Crouch's decision not to run for another term on the board. Today's report features the first of three candidates, Peter Bencker. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
